# Baseline B-02 (negotiation-2; also pins F-03): the range proposal
# 4.4 down to 4.2 (00 02 04 04) covers 4.4, so it is answered with the
# plain version 00 00 04 04, and the connection then serves a session:
# HELLO succeeds (ADR-0303). The leading C: <RAW> is the script's own
# handshake, so there is no automatic one and no !: AUTO HELLO.
!: AUTO GOODBYE

C: <RAW> 60 60 B0 17 00 02 04 04 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
S: <RAW> 00 00 04 04
C: HELLO {"user_agent": "relate-bolt-compat/1.0", "scheme": "none"}
S: SUCCESS {}
